# RENDER DASHBOARD REFERENCE — this file is NOT read by Render.
# Render static sites require headers to be set via Dashboard > Headers.
# This file documents the intended policy. Copy values into Render Dashboard.
#
# 13 entries total. Security baseline is global (/*), not per-HTML.
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# GLOBAL SECURITY BASELINE (/*) — 7 entries
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Path | Header Name                    | Value
# ─────┼────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────
# /*   | X-Content-Type-Options         | nosniff
# /*   | X-Frame-Options                | DENY
# /*   | Referrer-Policy                | strict-origin-when-cross-origin
# /*   | Permissions-Policy             | camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
# /*   | Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy     | same-origin
# /*   | Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy   | same-origin
# /*   | Strict-Transport-Security      | max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# GLOBAL CSP (/*) — 1 entry
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Path | Header Name                    | Value (single line)
# ─────┼────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────
# /*   | Content-Security-Policy        | default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://js.stripe.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' https://res.cloudinary.com data: blob:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://*.stripe.com https://api.cloudinary.com https://api.thesharedtablestory.com; frame-src https://js.stripe.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# HTML CACHE (/*.html) — 1 entry
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Path    | Header Name   | Value
# ────────┼───────────────┼──────────────────────────────────
# /*.html | Cache-Control | no-store
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# STATIC ASSET CACHE — 3 entries (CSS + JS + assets)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Note: /vendor/* also needs long-cache if Render supports it.
#
# Path     | Header Name   | Value
# ─────────┼───────────────┼──────────────────────────────────
# /css/*   | Cache-Control | public, max-age=31536000, immutable
# /js/*    | Cache-Control | public, max-age=31536000, immutable
# /assets/*| Cache-Control | public, max-age=31536000, immutable
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# WHAT'S ENFORCED VIA CODE (meta tags in all 25 HTML files):
#   - Content-Security-Policy (meta http-equiv)
#   - Referrer-Policy (meta name="referrer")
# These meta tags provide defense-in-depth alongside the Dashboard headers.
